lib/
├── core/                 ✅ Common code used across the app
├── data/                 ✅ Firebase, API logic
│   ├── datasources/      ✅ Actual Firebase or local data calls
│   └── repositories/     ✅ Implements domain repositories using datasources
├── domain/               ✅ Pure logic layer (no Firebase/Flutter dependencies)
│   ├── entities/         ✅ Models used in the app
│   └── repositories/     ✅ Abstract contracts for data access
├── application/          ✅ Business logic (usecases)
├── presentation/         ✅ UI + BLoC logic
│   ├── blocs/            ✅ All BLoC, Cubit, States, Events
│   ├── screens/          ✅ App screens like Home, Cart, Auth
│   └── widgets/          ✅ Reusable UI widgets
└── main.dart             ✅ App entry point
